' '--task' 'fixture-20261014-1' '--attempt' 'f893e876-fb67-47ce-83c0-3c9e7b665173' '--session' '600c9c98-eda8-4178-9e42-b656e55559bd' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":24,"time":"2026-10-14T04:56:04.331Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"f893e876-fb67-47ce-83c0-3c9e7b665173","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt_id":"f893e876-fb67-47ce-83c0-3c9e7b665173","session_id":"600c9c98-eda8-4178-9e42-b656e55559bd","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"f8520b30-920c-4d9e-9f18-55f464ab42a4","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"a09bb792-bb36-44b8-ae0b-8a7657cf94c1","thread":"f8520b30-920c-4d9e-9f18-55f464ab42a4","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-a09bb792-bb36-44b8-ae0b-8a7657cf94c1"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-rqd8dhbq/c-ydv_56b1/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261014-1-a1","base_commit":"5728f0ad65228f9c980e5ed273abaea672d57a7b","card_snapshot_id":"ab996c6b-60d1-4801-a7b6-8dea52564d22","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261014-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":25,"time":"2026-10-14T04:56:05.498Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"f893e876-fb67-47ce-83c0-3c9e7b665173","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-rqd8dhbq/c-ydv_56b1/repo","cat-file","-t","67e22375010c662dc89a5831e94f6508adf2e81d"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-rqd8dhbq/c-ydv_56b1/repo"}},{"seq":26,"time":"2026-10-14T04:56:05.504Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"f893e876-fb67-47ce-83c0-3c9e7b665173","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-rqd8dhbq/c-ydv_56b1/repo","cat-file","-t","67e22375010c662dc89a5831e94f6508adf2e81d"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-